# Title: PUA - NirCmd Execution
# ID: 4e2ed651-1906-4a59-a78a-18220fca1b22
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-01-24
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1569.002, attack.s0029
# Description: Detects the use of NirCmd tool for command execution, which could be the result of legitimate administrative activity
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((((process_exec="* execmd *" OR process_exec="*.exe script *" OR process_exec="*.exe shexec *" OR process_exec="* runinteractive *")) OR ((process_path="*\\NirCmd.exe") OR (process_name="NirCmd.exe"))) OR (((process_exec="* exec *" OR process_exec="* exec2 *")) AND ((process_exec="* show *" OR process_exec="* hide *"))))
